Curated by hand (reviewed in PRs, each row with a rationale):

- state_genes_human.csv, state_genes_mouse.csv: disease / state genes
  excluded from negative-gene lists (plan §4.7, §5.6) [L; reviewed in M4].
  Matched by Ensembl ID, resolved once from the WHB-10Xv3 var (human) and
  the WMB-10X gene.csv 20241115 (mouse).
- setc_families_human.csv, setc_exclusions_human.csv: the seeded set-a
  family (E5 296-gene and post-M0e 297-gene panel hashes) and its set-c
  exclusions, the 32 cross-platform-deviant genes of E5
  (exp/E5/04_make_genesets.py; plan §3.2, D-A7).
- wmb_marker_universe_ag7_vzg2.csv: the validated WMB marker-precompute
  gene universe, the ag7 | VZG2 union (899 genes) of
  research/selfmap/query_{ag7,vzg2}_full.h5ad; symbols from the WMB-10X
  gene.csv 20241115 (plan §7.1).
- heldout_markers_human.csv, heldout_markers_mouse.csv: independent
  held-out markers for the non-circular enrichment check (plan §5.8).
  Human: two canonical markers per class (rank 1) and canonical
  alternates (rank 2, added in M3 because set a lacks SATB2, PLP1, CSF1R,
  CLDN5 and LUM); SST deliberately absent; GAD2 and P2RY12 avoided on
  MERSCOPE. Mouse: the E3 VZG2 held-out microglial
  genes; class-level markers are still to be added (plan §5.8 step 4).
- gene_id_overrides_human.csv, gene_id_overrides_mouse.csv: curated
  symbol -> Ensembl gene ID rows of the gene-ID resolver (plan §8.4),
  each with its reason: the M0e MERSCOPE genes (H2AX, LIF, LIFR, SQSTM1;
  IDs from the WHB-10Xv3 var) and the MGI rename H2afx -> H2ax.
- validated_panels.csv, validated_panel_genes.csv and
  validated_panel_levels.csv: the validated panel families (plan §4.7,
  §8.2). Seeded real-data families (plan rev3, approved in PR #22):
  human_set_a (E5 set a, 296 genes, its post-M0e 297-gene form and their
  curated set c, 264 / 265 genes), mouse_ag7 (500 genes) and mouse_vzg2
  (815 genes). Gene lists from exp/E5/genes_{a,c}.csv and the M3 / M3b
  panel_genes.json files, each re-hashed to its panel_hash; root markers
  from the root key of the production primary bundles' query markers
  (root_marker_source; the 296- and 264-gene rows take those of their
  post-M0e sibling). validated_panel_levels.csv holds the per-(level,
  class) records of simulation-validated families only, added by gate-P
  PRs (M13).
- sim_inputs/ (M3c): simulation-input tables derived from public 10x
  Genomics Xenium datasets and panel definitions (OD-E1 amended
  2026-09-28), generated by scripts/annotation/build_sim_inputs.py with a
  provenance sidecar per table; see sim_inputs/NOTICE. They parameterise
  simulated cells only and never raise a trust state.

